              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Use Hardy–Weinberg equation 1 and equation 2 to calculate the percentage of the population of rats on the island that is heterozygous for warfarin resistance.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 9
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<b>equation 1</b>  <i>p</i> + <i>q</i> = 1",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 9
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "<b>equation 2</b>  <i>p</i><sup>2</sup> + 2<i>pq</i> + <i>q</i><sup>2</sup> = 1",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 9
                }
              },
